      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-20893-21312"><seg source="#source-20893-20905">それは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20905-20929"><rb>丁度</rb><rt>ちやうど</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20929-20950"><rb>日本</rb><rt>にほん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20950-20953">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20953-20977"><rb>國號</rb><rt>こくがう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20977-20980">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20980-21007"><rb>外人</rb><rt>ぐわいじん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21007-21010">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21010-21025"><rb>何</rb><rt>なん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21025-21028">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21028-21040"><rb>呼</rb><rt>よ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21040-21043">び</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21043-21058"><rb>何</rb><rt>なん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21058-21061">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21061-21073"><rb>書</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21073-21088">かうとも、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21088-21109"><rb>吾人</rb><rt>ごじん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21109-21112">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21112-21130"><rb>必</rb><rt>かなら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21130-21133">ず</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21133-21148"><rb>常</rb><rt>つね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21148-21151">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21151-21172"><rb>日本</rb><rt>にほん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21172-21175">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21175-21187"><rb>呼</rb><rt>よ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21187-21190">び</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21190-21211"><rb>日本</rb><rt>にほん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21211-21214">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21214-21226"><rb>書</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21226-21250">かねばならぬのと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21250-21265"><rb>同</rb><rt>おな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21265-21268">じ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21268-21289"><rb>理窟</rb><rt>りくつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21289-21312">である。（完）</seg></p>
